## Summary
TalkToMeInKorean is hosting a book giveaway where participants can win a copy of the upcoming book 'Korean Folktales in Everyday Conversation' by leaving reviews for purchased books on their website. The giveaway runs from October 27 to November 12, 2023, with 20 winners announced on November 17, 2023.

## Key Points
- Participants must leave reviews for books purchased on talktomeinkorean.com during the giveaway period to enter.
- 20 winners will receive a free copy of the new book 'Korean Folktales in Everyday Conversation'.
- The giveaway participation period is from October 27 to November 12, 2023.
- Winners will be announced on November 17, 2023, and contacted via email.
- The book will be officially launched and available for purchase in January 2024.


